WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.602
-The President and his goons
have been threatening everyone

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:05.804
from sitting Congressmen
to ambassadors

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:08.274
as new evidence emerges
in his impeachment trial.

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:10.810
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.845
♪♪

00:00:12.845 --> 00:00:14.880
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.049
I'm no lawyer,
but I'm pretty sure

00:00:17.049 --> 00:00:19.118
that when suspects
go on trial for crimes

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:21.954
they try not to commit
more crimes.

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:24.190
Donald Trump, however, is
a different sort of criminal.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:27.126
For Trump, crimes are kind of
like Lay's potato chips --

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:30.029
betcha can't do just one.

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:31.497
But, hey, you got to at least

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:33.132
give Trump points
for commitment.

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:34.533
One crime isn't enough for him.

00:00:34.533 --> 00:00:36.235
He's always got to do
like five at once.

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:37.870
He's like a guy
who steals a camcorder,

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:39.672
sneaks into a movie theater
without paying,

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:42.675
illegally records and sells
the bootleg DVD on the street,

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.577
gets arrested,
busts out of jail,

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:46.245
and then holds a screening
of the movie

00:00:46.245 --> 00:00:49.148
in a house he broke into.

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:52.184
For example, after Democrats,
led by Congressman Adam Schiff,

00:00:52.184 --> 00:00:53.419
completed their arguments

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:55.187
in the Senate impeachment trial
last week,

00:00:55.187 --> 00:00:56.656
Trump decided
to threaten Schiff,

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:59.559
who, of course, is also one of
the prosecutors in the trial.

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.495
First, here's a brief excerpt of
Schiff's detailed oral argument

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:05.431
in which he laid out the case
for removing Trump from office.

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:07.700
-Can any of us
really have the confidence

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:11.337
that Donald Trump
will put his personal interests

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:12.905
ahead of the national interests?

00:01:12.905 --> 00:01:15.808
You know you can't count on him
to do that.

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:17.143
That's the sad truth.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:20.480
You know you can't count on him
to do that.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:24.851
And you know you can't trust
this president

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:28.754
to do what's right
for this country.

00:01:28.754 --> 00:01:34.761
You can trust he will do
what's right for Donald Trump.

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:37.764
He'll do it now.
He's done it before.

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.499
He'll do it for
the next several months.

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:41.934
He'll do it in the election
if he's allowed to.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:44.504
-It's true. Donald Trump has
never done anything in his life

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.105
that didn't benefit him
personally.

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:48.374
I'm pretty sure when he placed
his hand on the Bible

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:49.708
to take the oath of office

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:53.345
he slipped Chief Justice
John Roberts a $20 bill.

00:01:53.345 --> 00:01:54.981
"There's more
where that came from

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:58.150
'cause I'm definitely
going to get impeached."

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:00.920
And that's why Schiff's
oral argument was so important.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.356
He laid out in detail
how our Constitution

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:05.624
set up the presidency
as a public trust

00:02:05.624 --> 00:02:08.060
and that Trump had repeatedly
violated that trust.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:10.630
And Trump
clearly saw Schiff's speech,

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.366
and he decided to menace Schiff
on Twitter on Sunday.

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:15.668
-"Shifty Adam Schiff
is a corrupt politician

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:17.603
and probably a very sick man.

00:02:17.603 --> 00:02:19.872
He has not paid the price yet

00:02:19.872 --> 00:02:21.875
for what he has done
to our country."

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:24.911
-Okay, first of all, what do you
mean he hasn't paid the price?

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:26.813
Almost everything Trump says

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:29.315
sounds like a deleted scene
from "The Irishman."

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:30.583
Just kidding.

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:34.387
There were no deleted scenes
from "The Irishman."

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:36.021
Also, he hasn't paid a price?

00:02:36.021 --> 00:02:38.791
No one has had a more charmed,
consequence-free life

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:40.259
than Donald Trump.

00:02:40.259 --> 00:02:42.461
He's like Mr. Magoo
driving off a cliff

00:02:42.461 --> 00:02:44.864
and then gently floating
down to the ground

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:46.899
because he accidentally
opened his umbrella.

00:02:46.899 --> 00:02:50.937
Except Mr. Magoo would actually
know how to close an umbrella.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.906
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.906 --> 00:02:56.309
Now, it seems like Trump was
probably lashing out at Schiff

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:59.078
after Schiff cited
a report from CBS

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:01.681
claiming that Trump had warned
Senate Republicans,

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:04.250
who are also supposed to be
impartial jurors in the trial,

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.584
not to cross him.

00:03:05.584 --> 00:03:06.952
Here's the CBS report

00:03:06.952 --> 00:03:09.655
and then Schiff's comments
citing that report.

00:03:09.655 --> 00:03:12.358
-One Trump confidant
tells CBS News

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:14.794
that GOP senators
had been warned --

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:18.597
"Vote against the President, and
your head will be on a pike."

00:03:18.597 --> 00:03:21.100
-CBS News reported last night

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:26.772
that a Trump confidant said
that GOP senators were warned,

00:03:26.772 --> 00:03:29.508
"Vote against your president --
Vote against the President,

00:03:29.508 --> 00:03:33.846
and your head
will be on a pike."

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:35.949
Now, I don't know
if that's true.

00:03:35.949 --> 00:03:38.651
-I'm gonna take a wild guess
and say it's definitely true.

00:03:38.651 --> 00:03:39.852
Although, I will say

00:03:39.852 --> 00:03:42.455
the only thing that makes me
doubt this story

00:03:42.455 --> 00:03:45.658
is the fact that Trump probably
has no idea what a pike is.

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:48.794
The only pike he's familiar with
is the New Jersey Turnpike.

00:03:48.794 --> 00:03:52.164
"I'm gonna put your head on
a pike. Exit 15 by Secaucus.

00:03:52.164 --> 00:03:55.468
Then me and my friends are
gonna go hit the mall!"

00:03:55.468 --> 00:03:57.437
Then after Schiff
made that comment,

00:03:57.437 --> 00:04:00.006
GOP senators feigned shock
that he would suggest

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:02.074
they might be beholden
to a president

00:04:02.074 --> 00:04:04.510
who has routinely threatened
anyone who crosses him.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:07.280
Senator John Barrasso said,
"He has basically offended

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.515
every Republican senator
in there tonight."

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:12.685
Senator Susan Collins said,
"I know of no Republican senator

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:14.186
who has been threatened
in any way

00:04:14.186 --> 00:04:16.021
by anyone
in the administration."

00:04:16.021 --> 00:04:19.124
And Senator Lisa Murkowski said,
"I thought he was doing fine

00:04:19.124 --> 00:04:21.894
with moral courage until
he got to the head on a pike.

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:23.729
That's where he lost me."

00:04:23.729 --> 00:04:25.698
Oh, is that where he lost you?

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:27.499
"I was gonna vote
to convict Trump,

00:04:27.499 --> 00:04:29.435
but then Schiff implied
he was a bully,

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:31.003
and that is where
I draw the line.

00:04:31.003 --> 00:04:33.405
What's next? Is Schiff gonna
claim Trump's a golfer

00:04:33.405 --> 00:04:38.077
who stands like a mama bear
scaring away a predator?"

00:04:38.077 --> 00:04:40.546
I mean, let's remember.
This is a guy who fights with

00:04:40.546 --> 00:04:43.249
or attacks literally anyone
who crosses him,

00:04:43.249 --> 00:04:45.484
including Republicans,
Gold Star families,

00:04:45.484 --> 00:04:47.619
and even his closest friends
and allies

00:04:47.619 --> 00:04:50.656
if they even so much
as question him in public.

00:04:50.656 --> 00:04:51.958
Trump has done this repeatedly.

00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:54.460
He went after former
GOP congressman Mark Sanford

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.662
and endorsed
Sanford's primary opponent

00:04:56.662 --> 00:04:58.831
just because Sanford
criticized him on TV.

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:00.666
And Trump
even brought up the fact

00:05:00.666 --> 00:05:03.168
that Sanford had covered up
an extramarital affair

00:05:03.168 --> 00:05:05.972
by claiming he'd been hiking
the Appalachian Trail.

00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:07.673
Although, as we've noted before,

00:05:07.673 --> 00:05:10.109
Trump kept getting
the name wrong.

00:05:10.109 --> 00:05:14.112
-He was supposed to
be vacationing

00:05:14.112 --> 00:05:15.581
on the Tallahassee Trail,

00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:19.284
but he was actually
in Argentina.

00:05:19.284 --> 00:05:20.786
I don't know --

00:05:20.786 --> 00:05:23.455
Jim, do they have a
Tallahassee Trail in Argentina?

00:05:23.455 --> 00:05:25.925
Never liked him too much.

00:05:25.925 --> 00:05:29.095
I wasn't a big fan.

00:05:29.095 --> 00:05:31.697
The Tallahassee Trail.
Must be a beautiful place.

00:05:31.697 --> 00:05:34.033
Unfortunately,
he didn't go there.

00:05:34.033 --> 00:05:36.502
-No, he didn't. Because...

00:05:36.502 --> 00:05:39.137
It doesn't exist.

00:05:39.137 --> 00:05:42.075
Tallahassee Trail sounds like
the patch of back hair

00:05:42.075 --> 00:05:44.443
that leads down into your jorts.

00:05:44.443 --> 00:05:45.978
[ Laughter ]

00:05:45.978 --> 00:05:47.279
So the President

00:05:47.279 --> 00:05:49.515
threatened the prosecutor
and the members of the jury

00:05:49.515 --> 00:05:52.618
in his Senate impeachment trial,
and then we also found out

00:05:52.618 --> 00:05:54.153
that he had seemingly threatened

00:05:54.153 --> 00:05:55.787
the former ambassador
to Ukraine,

00:05:55.787 --> 00:05:58.524
Marie Yovanovitch,
at a private dinner in 2018.

00:05:58.524 --> 00:06:00.326
You might recall
that Yovanovitch

00:06:00.326 --> 00:06:02.795
was a key witness in
the House impeachment hearing.

00:06:02.795 --> 00:06:04.997
She was seen as a crusader
against corruption

00:06:04.997 --> 00:06:07.666
and therefore an obstacle
to Trump and Rudy's corrupt plan

00:06:07.666 --> 00:06:09.701
to get Ukraine to dig up dirt
on Joe Biden,

00:06:09.701 --> 00:06:11.403
so Trump and Rudy
wanted her out.

00:06:11.403 --> 00:06:14.474
And last week, a tape surfaced
in which Trump could be heard

00:06:14.474 --> 00:06:16.809
talking about Yovanovitch
in menacing tones

00:06:16.809 --> 00:06:18.845
with two of his
indicted henchmen,

00:06:18.845 --> 00:06:20.212
Lev Parnas and Igor Fruman.

00:06:20.212 --> 00:06:21.914
Do you remember these two guys?

00:06:21.914 --> 00:06:25.985
If you have trouble remembering
who's who, Lev is the hot one.

00:06:25.985 --> 00:06:28.854
[ Laughter ]

00:06:28.854 --> 00:06:31.790
Now, you might remember that
Trump has repeatedly claimed

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:34.527
he doesn't know these two guys,
which is obviously a lie

00:06:34.527 --> 00:06:37.330
given how often
Trump has had to say it.

00:06:41.467 --> 00:06:44.269
-I don't know those gentlemen.
I don't know them.

00:06:44.269 --> 00:06:47.273
I don't know about them.
I don't know what they do.

00:06:47.273 --> 00:06:49.742
I will say this.
Parnas I don't know.

00:06:49.742 --> 00:06:52.011
I don't know him.
I don't know anything about him.

00:06:52.011 --> 00:06:54.180
Well, I don't know him.
I don't know Parnas.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.715
I don't know him at all,
don't know what he's about.

00:06:56.715 --> 00:06:59.385
Don't know where he comes from.
Know nothing about him.

00:06:59.385 --> 00:07:02.154
I don't know him. I don't
believe I've ever spoken to him.

00:07:02.154 --> 00:07:03.488
But I don't know him.

00:07:03.488 --> 00:07:05.858
I've never had a conversation
that I remember with him.

00:07:05.858 --> 00:07:09.695
I don't need the help of a man
that I never met before.

00:07:09.695 --> 00:07:11.397
I don't even know
who this man is.

00:07:11.397 --> 00:07:13.899
No, I don't know him.
I know nothing about him.

00:07:13.899 --> 00:07:15.434
-When you have to say

00:07:15.434 --> 00:07:17.469
you've never met someone
that many times,

00:07:17.469 --> 00:07:20.139
you've definitely met
that person.

00:07:20.139 --> 00:07:22.608
It's like if your wife asks,
"Do you know Julia next door?"

00:07:22.608 --> 00:07:24.810
And you said, "I don't know her,
never talked to her.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:27.046
Don't know who she is or where
she came from or what she does.

00:07:27.046 --> 00:07:28.747
I've never spoken to her.
I've never m--

00:07:28.747 --> 00:07:30.716
I've never had a conversation.

00:07:30.716 --> 00:07:34.020
Who is she? Why are y--
I don't know her."

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:36.088
Your wife would have
her bags packed

00:07:36.088 --> 00:07:38.290
before you finished talking.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.459
Well, to no one's surprise,
it turns out Trump very much

00:07:40.459 --> 00:07:43.462
did know these guys, and now
we have an audio recording

00:07:43.462 --> 00:07:46.432
of Trump talking to Parnas
at a private dinner in 2018

00:07:46.432 --> 00:07:48.233
that's in the hands
of federal authorities

00:07:48.233 --> 00:07:51.036
in which they discuss
getting rid of Yovanovitch.

00:07:51.036 --> 00:07:53.705
-ABC News has reviewed a
recording of what appears to be

00:07:53.705 --> 00:07:57.643
a conversation between Parnas,
the President, and others.

00:07:57.643 --> 00:07:59.111
A copy of the recording

00:07:59.111 --> 00:08:01.914
is in the hands of the U.S.
Attorney's office in New York.

00:08:01.914 --> 00:08:03.916
Sources familiar
with the recording say

00:08:03.916 --> 00:08:07.486
it was made in April 2018
at a private dinner

00:08:07.486 --> 00:08:09.922
at the Trump International Hotel
in Washington.

00:08:09.922 --> 00:08:12.825
Parnas and the President
are heard discussing Ukraine

00:08:12.825 --> 00:08:15.795
and the American ambassador
there, Marie Yovanovitch.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:30.610
-How is it possible
that so many people

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.411
have secret recordings
of the President?

00:08:32.411 --> 00:08:35.447
I mean, this idiot has had more
microphones and hidden cameras

00:08:35.447 --> 00:08:38.117
on him than Jim Carrey
in "The Truman Show."

00:08:38.117 --> 00:08:40.419
Michael Cohen had
secret recordings of Trump.

00:08:40.419 --> 00:08:43.288
Omarosa had secret recordings
of Trump. And now this guy.

00:08:43.288 --> 00:08:45.524
Trump was so worried
about Obama spying on him,

00:08:45.524 --> 00:08:48.494
he failed to notice
that everyone else was.

00:08:48.494 --> 00:08:50.829
This is why it's so crucial
that the Senate vote to allow

00:08:50.829 --> 00:08:53.199
new evidence to be considered
in the impeachment trial

00:08:53.199 --> 00:08:55.334
because almost every day
new evidence emerges.

00:08:55.334 --> 00:08:57.870
In fact, just last night,
we got more bombshell reporting

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.772
about a tell-all book
being written by Trump's

00:08:59.772 --> 00:09:01.840
former national-security
adviser, John Bolton.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.942
You might remember that,
according to witnesses,

00:09:03.942 --> 00:09:08.114
Bolton had wanted no part of
Trump and Rudy's Ukraine scheme,

00:09:08.114 --> 00:09:10.482
calling it a "drug deal"
and saying Giuliani's

00:09:10.482 --> 00:09:13.019
"a hand grenade who's going to
blow everybody up.'

00:09:13.019 --> 00:09:16.889
Of course, if anything, Rudy
looks like he blew himself up.

00:09:16.889 --> 00:09:18.591
That's how he lost his neck.

00:09:18.591 --> 00:09:20.059
"Luckily they were able

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:22.794
to sew my head
right back onto my shoulders!"

00:09:22.794 --> 00:09:24.763
Now it turns out that
in his forthcoming book

00:09:24.763 --> 00:09:27.700
Bolton plans to lay out
in detail that Trump told him

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.868
explicitly
that he wanted to hold up

00:09:29.868 --> 00:09:32.271
hundreds of millions of dollars
in aid to Ukraine in order to

00:09:32.271 --> 00:09:35.107
force them to help him cheat
in the 2020 election.

00:09:35.107 --> 00:09:36.441
-"The New York Times" reports

00:09:36.441 --> 00:09:39.011
that former national-security
adviser John Bolton's

00:09:39.011 --> 00:09:41.847
upcoming book
will say the President

00:09:41.847 --> 00:09:43.916
personally tied aid to Ukraine

00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:46.586
to an investigation
of the Bidens.

00:09:46.586 --> 00:09:48.654
-It's insane.
Every day, someone new

00:09:48.654 --> 00:09:50.756
comes forward with more evidence
against Trump.

00:09:50.756 --> 00:09:53.626
Gordon Sondland,
Lev Parnas, John Bolton.

00:09:53.626 --> 00:09:55.394
Tomorrow, the pilot
on Air Force One

00:09:55.394 --> 00:09:56.895
is going to come forward
and be like, "The President

00:09:56.895 --> 00:10:00.499
ordered me to illegally park
in a handicapped spot."

00:10:00.499 --> 00:10:02.601
The president and his cabal
of thuggish goons

00:10:02.601 --> 00:10:04.536
have threatened everyone
from ambassadors

00:10:04.536 --> 00:10:06.105
to members of Congress

00:10:06.105 --> 00:10:08.174
as new evidence emerges
every day of his crimes.

00:10:08.174 --> 00:10:10.609
And Republicans
are feigning false outrage

00:10:10.609 --> 00:10:12.844
at an innocuous comment
by Adam Schiff

00:10:12.844 --> 00:10:14.846
just to distract
from the actual case.

00:10:14.846 --> 00:10:17.582
If Trump had any shame at all,
he'd resign and disappear

00:10:17.582 --> 00:10:19.351
someplace no one could find him
like...

00:10:19.351 --> 00:10:21.386
-The Tallahassee Trail.

00:10:21.386 --> 00:10:23.022
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:23.022 --> 00:10:25.257
[ Cheers and applause ]

